@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@postId = 1

### 1. 먼저 실행: 쿠키는 IntelliJ HTTP Client가 보관
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csrf
Authorization: Basic student1 demo-pass

> {% client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.data.token); %}

### 2. 최초 참여 201 / 재참여 200 (Body 없음)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/participants
Authorization: Basic student1 demo-pass
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### 3. 내 상태
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/participants/me
Authorization: Basic student1 demo-pass

### 4. 참여 중 명단 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/participants
Authorization: Basic student1 demo-pass

### 5. 참여 취소
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/participants
Authorization: Basic student1 demo-pass
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### 6. 취소 후 명단 조회: 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/participants
Authorization: Basic student1 demo-pass

### 7. 재참여: 기존 ID 유지
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/participants
Authorization: Basic student1 demo-pass
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### 8. 본인 내역
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/participations?page=0&size=20&status=JOINED
Authorization: Basic student1 demo-pass

### 작성자 명단 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/participants
Authorization: Basic author demo-pass
